@startuml
title UC07 Register Arrival — black-box SSD
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 350
hide footbox
actor "Authorised administrative staff" as Actor
participant "Appointment Tracking System\n(black box)" as System

note over Actor, System
  UC07 steps 1–8. Session actor is implicit; no clinical record is required for check-in.
  Appointment dates and today's date are interpreted at the appointment's clinic location.
end note

Actor -> System : searchPatient(criteria)
alt invalid criteria, denied scope or no permitted matches
  break Patient identification failed — no appointment lookup or arrival follows
    System --> Actor : safe failure / no matches; denial audited when applicable
  end
else permitted patient matches
  System --> Actor : minimal identity matches with patientIDs
end
note over Actor
  Verify one patient. If ambiguous, repeat
  searchPatient with refined criteria first.
end note

Actor -> System : findAppointment(patientID,date)
alt denied/invalid lookup or no permitted appointment matches
  break Appointment lookup failed — registerArrival cannot follow
    System --> Actor : safe failure / no appointments; no state change
  end
else permitted appointment summaries exist
  System --> Actor : appointmentIDs, services, professionals, locations, local starts, statuses, arrival indications
end
note over Actor
  Select the intended appointment explicitly.
  Multiple matches do not authorise batch check-in.
end note

Actor -> System : registerArrival(appointmentID)
alt no administrative authority or appointment no longer exists
  break Arrival denied
    System --> Actor : safe denial; audit metadata; no state change
  end
else status is not confirmed OR appointment local date is not today
  break Appointment is ineligible for arrival
    System --> Actor : safe state/date failure; arrival and status unchanged
  end
else confirmed, today locally, arrivalTime already present
  System --> Actor : alreadyArrived (duplicate rejected), original arrivalTime, confirmed\n(no overwrite or duplicate successful write)
else confirmed, today locally, arrivalTime absent
  alt arrival write and required audit evidence retained
    System --> Actor : appointmentID, current arrivalTime, confirmed
  else write or required audit retention fails
    break No new arrival committed
      System --> Actor : arrival failed; previous arrival/status preserved
    end
  end
end

note over Actor, System
  Success writes arrivalTime, not an "arrived" status. Requested, cancelled and
  completed appointments cannot be checked in. Confirmation is separate UC04.
  Sensitive reads, successful writes and denied actions are audited without clinical content.
  UC07 extensions 1a/2a, 3a/4a, 6a/6b and 7a; rules BR01–BR02, BR06–BR07, BR09, BR13.
end note
@enduml
